        "id": 1086611
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-01-27T23:04:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is the beginning of a series of CLs. There will be logic to handle this. WifiStateMachine#setTargetBssid and WifiStateMachine#clearTargetBssid are used to enforce this. Currently there is no plan to compile a blacklist as I cannot think of a very good way to generate such a list.",
      "revId": "21f7c746784993d3002f9a2da59575a70544ecfa",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
